+            <t indent="0" pn="section-3.4-17.2.1">(path #4, Fig.5)</t>
+            <t indent="0" pn="section-3.4-17.2.2">These are original packets originating on this node that undergo encapsulation. The original packet source and tunnel entry-point are the same node.</t>
+          </dd>
+          <dt pn="section-3.4-17.3">(l.i.2) a link-layer</dt>
+          <dd pn="section-3.4-17.4">
